      "content": "hey so i just ate a huge bowl of pasta and i think it was like 120g of carbs... i'm really worried my sugar is gonna spike. my doc told me to use a ratio of 1:5 but i think i messed up the math. if i take 25 units of rapid acting insulin will that cover the pasta and my correction? i need to know real quick so i dont feel sick",
