      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for explaining the glucagon thing, but the mg/kg math is confusing me. i'm around 70kg so if i just take like 10mg of glucagon it should be enough right? and honestly i'm also on some other meds for my blood pressure, i'm worried they might clash with the insulin or the glucagon. can you just check if there's any major danger if i take them together so i can just handle this at home and not go to the ER?",
